1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,500
Welcome, friends.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,708
I’ll be right down.

3
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,250
Could I interest you in some peppermint tea?

4
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:17,167
What are you guys?

5
00:00:17,167 --> 00:00:20,917
We are sprites. We sprite balance to the forest.

6
00:00:20,917 --> 00:00:26,167
We take care of the animals, plants, birds, moss…

7
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,417
Guys? Guys, I…

8
00:00:33,083 --> 00:00:38,042
Hey, uh, little mushroom geezer, you cool with us camping here for the night?

9
00:00:38,042 --> 00:00:42,833
Absolutely. A friend of the forest is a friend of the sprites.
